## 🔥 SIZE LIMITS & REFACTORING TRIGGERS

### Component Size Enforcement
- **UI Components**: MAX 100 lines (simple, reusable)
- **Layout Components**: MAX 150 lines
- **Feature Components**: MAX 300 lines (ABSOLUTE LIMIT)
- **Hook Functions**: MAX 50 lines
- **Utility Functions**: MAX 30 lines

### MANDATORY Refactoring Triggers
- **200+ lines**: STOP and plan refactoring immediately
- **300+ lines**: MUST refactor before continuing - NO EXCEPTIONS
- **JSX >50 lines**: Extract sub-components
- **Logic >50 lines**: Extract custom hooks
- **>7 props**: Consider composition or reducer pattern
- **>5 hooks in component**: Extract custom hooks
- **>3 event handlers**: Extract to custom hooks
- **Nested components >3 levels**: Extract sub-components

### Extraction Patterns (IMMEDIATE ACTION)
```typescript
// ❌ BAD: Large monolithic component (>300 lines)
